00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:13,080
 or a little bit of salt on a chocolate chip cookies.

37
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:15,600
 And so today we're going to see that less is more.

38
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:18,140
 It's actually not just a good advice.

39
00:02:18,140 --> 00:02:20,500
 It is actually a principle that is deeply woven

40
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:23,280
 into how God chooses to work sometimes.

41
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:27,200
 (speaking in foreign language)

42
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:32,800
, so we've seen that in the past.

