00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:00,080
 We have been journeying through the book of Judges so far

44
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:03,440
 and currently we are in the cycle of Gideon.

45
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:07,080
 Last time we saw that when God called Gideon to save Israel,

46
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:10,760
 he was very hesitant because he let his fears hold him back

