00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:26,160
 and the coalitions.

54
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:30,400
 But before that, God has one more thing for Gideon.

55
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:32,680
 So let's look at Judges seven together today.

56
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:36,600
 (speaking in foreign language)

57
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,240
 - So verse one, "Early in the morning, Jerubbaal,

58
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:02,120
 "that is Gideon, and all his men camped

59
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,960
 "at the spring of Harol.

60
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:06,520
 "The camp of Midian was north of them in the valley

