 "The Lord said to Gideon, 'You have too many men.

63
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:14,080
 "'I cannot deliver Midian into their hands,

64
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:16,200
 "'or Israel will boast against me.

65
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:18,000
 "'You have too many men.'

66
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:21,120
 "Jerubbaal said to Gideon, 'You have too many men.

67
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:23,200
 "'I cannot deliver Midian into their hands,

68
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:25,200
 "'or Israel will boast against me.

69
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:28,480
 "'Saying, 'My own strength has saved me.'"

70
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:32,400
 (speaking in foreign language)

71
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:52,160
 - And so as Gideon and his army,

72
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:55,360
 they are getting ready for the battle,

73
00:04:55,360 --> 00:05:00,080
 the Lord finds a problem, that they have too many men.

74
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:02,960
 Think about it, why is God so concerned with this,

75
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:04,880
 that he literally has to interrupt

76
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:06,640
 Israel's battle preparation?

77
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:09,480
 If we take a closer look,

78
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:13,080
 the number of men is actually not the root cause.

79
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:15,000
 The real problem here, as verse two tell us,

80
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,320
 is that Israel would boast against the Lord,

81
00:05:17,320 --> 00:05:19,720
 and kind of like credit the victory

82
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:24,920
 as their own strength that brings them the victory.

83
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:28,840
 (speaking in foreign language)

84
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,800
 So this is not a numerical problem,

85
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:56,160
 but it is actually a hard problem.

86
00:05:56,160 --> 00:06:00,600
 And so God has to deal with it before the battle begins.

87
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,560
 And so to deal with these root issues,

88
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,800
 the Lord gave them a special plan.

89
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:07,200
 A less is more kind of plan.

90
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:09,880
 Less dependence on the numbers or their own strength,

91
