 and more dependence on the Lord.

92
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:16,080
 (speaking in foreign language)

93
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:24,720
 (speaking in foreign language)

94
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:31,080
 So in our passage today,

95
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:33,360
 we're going to look at this main idea together,

96
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:37,320
 that self-sufficiency, that is relying on our own strength,

97
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:39,760
